## Layout

| Path | What |
|---|---|
| `docs/` | Catalog, playbook, templates, decisions (`docs/adr/`), lessons, sessions |
{%- if has_api %}
| `api/` | Python API (FastAPI): `/health`, `/health/ready`, settings registry, job table and worker, deploy gate |
| `db/migrations/` | SQL migrations, keys `{{ migration_prefix }}-NNN` |
{%- endif %}
{%- if has_web %}
| `web/` | Next.js web app (BFF): security headers, cross-site write guard |
{%- endif %}
{%- if has_lambda %}
| `lambda/` | AWS Lambda function (Python) |
{%- endif %}
{%- if has_infra %}
| `infra/` | Terraform root: tags, budget alert, CI deploy role (OIDC), state backend |
{%- endif %}
| `tools/` | Docs and safety checks run by CI and the pre-push hook |
| `.claude/` | Agent hooks (guardrails) and generic skills |

## Checks

```bash
bash scripts/setup.sh        # once: hooks path, so the pre-push hook runs
bash scripts/pre-push.sh     # the fast checks the hook runs
```

